"""3CX Configuration REST API CLI Tool

Compatibility facade: the command and parser implementations live in the
``threecx`` package (config_people / config_routing / config_operations /
config_infrastructure / config_outbound / config_parser). This module keeps
every previously observable name — helpers, handlers, constants, imported
modules, and ``main()`` — and resolves itself as the runtime facade so
module-level monkeypatches (e.g. on ``cx_config``) keep working at call time.
"""

